      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>scale back? i dont think i can. it's not just a dry spell, it's like the well has literally run dry. i look at my old work and i can see exactly where the magic was, and i know i'll never touch it again. it's actually painful to keep trying because every new thing i make just proves how much i've declined. it feels like i'm just performing a parody of myself at this point.",
